{3000}{Leave me be, fool.}
{3001}{Blood and Sand! Why are you bothering me, idiot?}
{3002}{Bugger off, will you? I'm busy.}
{3003}{Why does an idiot such as yourself feel the need to bother me?}
{3004}{You look no better than you smell.}
{3005}{I do not like to be bothered by addle-brains like you. Hear me?}
{3006}{What is it, fool?}
{3007}{Scum.  I'd rather not speak to your kind.}
{3008}{Leave me be before I gut you, fool.}
{3009}{Bugger off, dolt.}

{3050}{You humans are the worst of the lot...}
{3051}{Bugger off, human! I'm busy.}
{3052}{You're a addle-brained human if ever I saw one...}
{3053}{Humans!  They should lock up the lot of you...}
