{6005}{Oh my! Watch you do not get stepped on down there.}
{6006}{Ods bodkins! You are a mite wee thing, are you not?}


{6050}{Look at the tiny human!}
{6051}{Holy Word! What an ugly pixie.}
{6052}{Hmm. Awfully skinny for a halfling. And your feet are too small!}
{6053}{My! What a tiny nose for a gnome!}
{6054}{Oh my! I have never seen such a sickly looking dwarf before!}
{6055}{Go away, child. You bother me.}
{6056}{Hmm. What are you? A tiny human?}
{6057}{I did not think you humans came in such varied sizes . . . especially so small!}
{6058}{My word! You are a wee little human!}

